    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "text": "If arriving a calendar day earlier matters, the January 16 arrival is the standout alternative. It leaves SFO at 11:45 a.m.—11½ hours before the late-departure option—but its reported whole-journey time is nearly the same: 19 hours 40 minutes versus 19 hours 35 minutes. The earlier arrival comes from taking that much earlier departure, rather than from a shorter overall journey.",
